'''''Rhynchostele''''' is a [[genus]] of [[flowering plant]]s from the orchid family, [[Orchidaceae]], native to [[Mexico]], [[Central America]] and [[Venezuela]].<ref name="WCSP">[http://apps.kew.org/wcsp/namedetail.do?name_id=178355 Kew World Checklist of Selected Plant Families]</ref><ref>Soto Arenas, Miguel Angel & Salazar Chávez, Gerardo Adolfo. 1993. Orquídea (Mexico City), n.s. 13(1–2): 150.</ref><ref>Hágsater, E. & M. Soto. 2003. Orchids of Mexico. Icones Orchidacearum (Mexico) 5–6: i–xxii, t. 501–t. 700.</ref>
The genus name is abbreviated as '''''Rst.''''' in the horticultural trade.

